{"src":"en","tgt":"de","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":164500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"de","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":6181.057305,"text":"But after losing the captain's wicket, India only made 36 runs, losing seven was a big"},{"kind":"text","t":6631.219198000001,"text":"Doch nach dem Verlust des Wickets des Kapitäns erzielte Indien nur 36 Runs, wobei der Verlust von sieben ein großer"},{"kind":"audio","t":7311.476495000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7312.879507,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7314.422119000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":7316.280706,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":7318.142558,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7318.885797000001,"samples":15603,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":12774.943713,"text":"They usually have special food, drink, and entertainment offers to keep guests in a good mood and to keep them at the premise."},{"kind":"text","t":13408.71988,"text":"Normalerweise gibt es spezielle Angebote für Speisen, Getränke und Unterhaltung, um die Gäste bei guter Laune zu halten und sie dazu zu bewegen, länger vor Ort zu bleiben."},{"kind":"audio","t":14259.508949000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14260.767494,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14262.626061,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14264.411809,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14266.201483,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14268.026369,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14269.618296,"samples":28532,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"input","t":19256.787082000003,"text":"Del Potro has the early advantage in the second set, but this is too required a tie break after"},{"kind":"text","t":19624.292666,"text":"Del Potro hat den frühen Vorteil im zweiten Satz, aber dies führt zu einem Tie-Break."},{"kind":"audio","t":20087.760366000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20088.88572,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20090.765429,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20091.618502999998,"samples":13987,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":25293.936647000002,"text":"The internet combines elements of both mass and interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"text","t":25627.619484000003,"text":"Das Internet vereint Elemente der Massenkommunikation und der zwischenmenschlichen Kommunikation."},{"kind":"audio","t":26080.7399,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26082.220668,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26083.877722999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26084.866289999998,"samples":20953,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"input","t":34459.838457,"text":"The composition of these crystals matches those found in urine of affected pets when compared by infrared spectroscopy."},{"kind":"text","t":35090.525354,"text":"Die Zusammensetzung dieser Kristalle stimmt im Vergleich mittels Infrarotspektroskopie mit denen überein, die im Urin betroffener Haustiere gefunden wurden."},{"kind":"audio","t":35841.505128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35842.971565,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35844.837222999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":35846.581839,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35848.381528,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35850.357331,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35850.573847,"samples":6520,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":36880.008121,"text":"F-T-I-R."},{"kind":"text","t":36974.175906,"text":"FTIR."},{"kind":"audio","t":37064.150129,"samples":20061,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":42283.146476999995,"text":"on some routes the larger companies have their own planes but for other routes and smaller firms there was a"},{"kind":"text","t":42707.968629999996,"text":"Auf einigen Strecken setzen die größeren Unternehmen eigene Flugzeuge ein, aber für andere Strecken und kleinere Firmen gab es eine"},{"kind":"audio","t":43350.525241999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43351.987112999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43353.940423,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":43355.684907999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":43357.463636,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43357.618198,"samples":5572,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":49536.572338,"text":"Some atoms have unstable nuclei, which means that they tend to break up"},{"kind":"text","t":49946.722477999996,"text":"Einige Atome haben instabile Kerne, was bedeutet, dass sie dazu neigen, zu zerfallen."},{"kind":"audio","t":50431.692051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50433.577679999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50434.960781,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50436.305515,"samples":26805,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"input","t":53487.74243,"text":"and break apart with little or no nudging."},{"kind":"text","t":53741.010000999995,"text":"und ohne oder mit nur geringem Anstoß zu zerfallen."},{"kind":"audio","t":53993.576807,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53994.869292999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":53995.011116,"samples":501,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":60661.713641999995,"text":"The same month saw another airliner overrun a runway at Moshland and strike a wall killing 17."},{"kind":"text","t":61356.024922,"text":"Im selben Monat überrollte ein weiteres Passagierflugzeug in Moshland die Start- und Landebahn und prallte gegen eine Mauer, wobei 17 Menschen ums Leben kamen."},{"kind":"audio","t":62157.248117999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62158.698612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":62160.422627,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62162.134493,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62163.929004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":62166.399362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62166.883932,"samples":16551,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":67239.386126,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":67592.098334,"text":"Es sind fast alles Sandstrände mit sicherem Badewasser und die meisten bieten Schatten durch"},{"kind":"audio","t":68079.588751,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68080.750881,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68082.518491,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68083.48026899999,"samples":19839,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":70270.002713,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":70429.19869399999,"text":"Pohican-Bäume."},{"kind":"audio","t":70548.652678,"samples":24241,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":930},{"kind":"input","t":76449.052077,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, water polo, fencing, rugby,"},{"kind":"text","t":76819.983587,"text":"Zu den beliebten Sportarten gehören Fußball, Basketball, Volleyball, Wasserball, Fechten, Rugby,"},{"kind":"audio","t":77388.539259,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77389.645984,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":77391.370049,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77393.12355799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77393.974459,"samples":9919,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":80696.193224,"text":"cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and F1."},{"kind":"text","t":80995.371967,"text":"Radsport, Eishockey, Rollhockey und Formel 1."},{"kind":"audio","t":81351.964015,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81353.185484,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81354.167001,"samples":21678,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"input","t":86542.531483,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was not so important."},{"kind":"text","t":86842.107344,"text":"Im warmen Klima des Nahen Ostens war das Haus nicht so wichtig."},{"kind":"audio","t":87194.601154,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":87195.676813,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87196.467182,"samples":19448,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"input","t":93199.748222,"text":"Lake Olai lies 120 kilometers north of Peninsula. The largest"},{"kind":"text","t":93562.16207199999,"text":"Der Olai-See liegt 120 Kilometer nördlich der Halbinsel. Der größte"},{"kind":"audio","t":94014.091585,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":94015.269238,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":94016.96326799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":94017.194346,"samples":8414,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"audio","t":94018.150695,"samples":19783,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":98335.069937,"text":"The cabbage juice changes color depending on how acidic, basic, alkaline the chemical is."},{"kind":"text","t":98794.541483,"text":"Der Kohlsaft ändert seine Farbe je nachdem, wie sauer, basisch oder alkalisch die Chemikalie ist."},{"kind":"audio","t":99329.060534,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99330.154941,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99331.830984,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99333.666417,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":99333.824975,"samples":724,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":105764.712118,"text":"The bridge is scheduled to be fully operational in September 2017 when the Brazilian custom checkpoints are expected to be finished."},{"kind":"text","t":106353.535875,"text":"Die Brücke soll im September 2017 voll funktionsfähig sein, wenn die brasilianischen Zollkontrollstellen voraussichtlich fertiggestellt sind."},{"kind":"audio","t":107165.650645,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107167.050973,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107168.864752,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107170.612714,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107172.292151,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107174.72444199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":107174.960257,"samples":3455,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":113165.95274,"text":"The moisture on your hands will react with the outer layers, which will feel funny and form a sort of shell."},{"kind":"text","t":113709.99702899999,"text":"Die Feuchtigkeit an Ihren Händen wird mit den äußeren Schichten reagieren, was sich eigenartig anfühlen wird und eine Art Schale bildet."},{"kind":"audio","t":114366.669037,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114368.031628,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114369.777206,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114371.51487099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114373.014488,"samples":28588,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"input","t":119591.411113,"text":"One bomb exploded outside the Governor's General's office."},{"kind":"text","t":119879.44183699999,"text":"Eine Bombe explodierte vor dem Büro des Generalgouverneurs."},{"kind":"audio","t":120211.54766,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120212.76384099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120213.098975,"samples":12204,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":125299.152646,"text":"The Moroccan Sultan rebuilt the city as Daru i Bayt"},{"kind":"text","t":125645.82436299999,"text":"Der marokkanische Sultan baute die Stadt als Daru i Bayt wieder auf."},{"kind":"audio","t":126038.028161,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126039.673888,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126041.189239,"samples":29758,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"input","t":130415.96678500001,"text":"and it was given the name Casablanca by Spanish traders who established trading bases."},{"kind":"text","t":130811.072802,"text":"und sie erhielt den Namen Casablanca von spanischen Händlern, die dort Handelsstützpunkte errichteten."},{"kind":"audio","t":131331.479483,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131332.631216,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131334.33772500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131335.553495,"samples":24297,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"input","t":142806.05408,"text":"He was greeted by Singapore's Deputy Prime Minister Wong Kan-seng and discussed trade and terrorism issues with the Singapore Prime Minister Lee Hsien Long."},{"kind":"text","t":143552.26075900003,"text":"Er wurde vom stellvertretenden Premierminister Singapurs, Wong Kan-seng, empfangen und erörterte Handels- und Terrorismusfragen mit dem singapurischen Premierminister Lee Hsien Long."},{"kind":"audio","t":144552.948356,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144554.490177,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144556.093189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":144557.79723400003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144559.68802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144561.503903,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144563.271554,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144564.02197300002,"samples":16941,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":154268.27983,"text":"The fission bomb works on the principle that it takes energy to put together a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":154785.22878600002,"text":"Die Fissionsbombe funktioniert nach dem Prinzip, dass Energie benötigt wird, um einen Kern mit vielen Protonen und Neutronen zusammenzusetzen."},{"kind":"audio","t":155534.40095900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155535.636138,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155537.29495500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":155539.244409,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155540.89889900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155541.76467200002,"samples":19504,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":162838.351357,"text":"In the archipelago and lakes you do not necessarily 